  "description": "One API over the Agora Interactive Whiteboard SDK for Android and iOS: join a room, pick a tool and colour, draw, undo, redo and clear, with awaitable calls and ordinary .NET events instead of a per-platform adapter over a Java Promise and an Objective-C completion block. Pulls in the platform binding that matches whichever target framework you build. Add Net.Agora.Whiteboard.Maui in a .NET MAUI app to get the board as a MAUI view.",
